<#46a0ff>BUTTONS (GBVS RISING)</>
  A = L, B = M, C = H, X = U.

<#46a0ff>POWER RAISE</>
Power Raise		^X
  Hold X to charge: 3 levels (green, blue, purple). Let go to
  strike. Higher levels hit harder and launch higher.
  Level 3: extra reach, invincible start-up, and the hit
  wall-bounces the opponent back to Gran.
Store the charge (while charging)		^A / ^B / ^C / _B
  Press X again later to keep charging from the stored level,
  or tap it to strike right away.
  Can be cancelled into from normals (not dash attacks or 2U).

<#46a0ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Throw		^Y  or  ^A_+^B
Brave Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		^B_+^C
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B

<#46a0ff>NORMALS</>
  Close and far versions change with distance.
  Chain on hit or block: L into M into H into Power Raise (X).
Close / Far L		^A
Close / Far M		^B
Close / Far H		^C
Crouching L / M / H		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
  2L hits low. 2H is the anti-air.
2U (low, hard knockdown)		_D^X
Dash L / M (low) / H		_F_F^A / ^B / ^C
Air L / M / H / U		^A / ^B / ^C / ^X
  No air chains. j.U crosses up.

<#46a0ff>TRIPLE ATTACK</>
Triple Attack		close normal, same button twice more
  ^A^A^A, ^B^B^B or ^C^C^C. The third hit ends the string.
Low ender (after the second hit)		_F^B
Overhead ender (after the second hit)		_F^C

<#46a0ff>SKILLS</>
  Cancel from normals on hit or block.
Reginleiv		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  L: fireball. M: rising slash then fireball. H: 3 hits.
Rising Sword		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  L: no invincibility. M and H: invincible reversal.
Overdrive Surge		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  After L hits: _D_DB_B^B or ^C follow-up.
  H wall-bounces in the corner.

<#46a0ff>ULTIMATE SKILLS (1 bar)</>
Ultimate Reginleiv		_D_DF_F^X
  Knockdown, wall-bounces in the corner.
Ultimate Rising Sword		_F_D_DF^X
Ultimate Overdrive Surge		_D_DB_B^X

<#46a0ff>SKYBOUND ARTS</>
Tempest Blade (2 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
Eternal Edge (+1 bar, during the first hit)		_D_DF_F^X
Catastrophe (3 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^X
